WEBVTT

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.080
<i>Princess Tagitsu escaped to the netherworld,</i>

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.810
<i>detached a part of herself,
 and launched it high into the sky.</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.480
<i>Aradama rained down all 
over the Kanto region.</i>

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:26.560
<i>After this incident, known as the Kamakura 
Special Hazardous Waste Leakage Problem,</i>

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.790
<i>aradama have begun to appear more
 frequently in the Kanto region.</i>

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.110
The aradama that was led 
to Daiba is currently

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:33.830
heading toward the commercial district.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.910
Distance from deployed unit is 2,000.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.950
Evacuation along the predicted 
path of the target objective

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.080
approaching the vicinity of 
Omiya has been completed.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.300
Aradama is moving in on
 Lake Sayama. What are your orders?

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.830
Move the 5th Platoon to the west bank 
of Lake Sayama and have them lie in wait.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.470
Where are the reinforcements 
for the bay area?

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:51.690
Two Toji with S Equipment are 
hurrying to the location.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.710
After the volley, we rush it.

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.900
Match your timing!

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.070
If we do it like we did in training,
 we can succeed!

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.740
Here it comes!

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.650
Draw your swords!

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:13.010
Utsushi!

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.060
Okay, rush attack!

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.830
Sayaka-chan!

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.150
I'm Etou Kanami, here to reinforce you.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.400
I'm Itomi Sayaka.

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.810
We are grateful for your support.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.160
We can handle the rest.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.040
Right, please do.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.530
E-Excuse me...

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.160
You both were at the event four months ago?

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.450
Yes, that's right!

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.170
I knew it!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.340
Are you from Ayanokouji?

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.710
Yes! I've been temporarily transferred 
to work with the special task force!

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:47.720
I'm Uchizato Ayumu, a first-year student
 at Ayanokouji's middle school!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:48.710
Ayumu-chan.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.040
I-I'm also staying at the 
headquarters in Kamakura!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.230
I've seen you both in the 
dorms so many times!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.710
Uchizato, we're in the middle of a mission.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.980
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.770
We'll see you later, then, at the dorm!

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.770
Okay!

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.280
You look happy, Kanami.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.450
What is it, Sayaka-chan?

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:47.920
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:52.950
<i>Capturing US military vessels 
and firing on unknown vessels...</i>

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:54.350
<b>Episode 13  Hero of the Next Generation</b>

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.660
<i>What do you think about how 
uneasy the citizens are</i>

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.660
<i>and the harm they have suffered?</i>

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.310
<i>Witness Origami?</i>

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:04.940
<b>Miss Origami Akane's Witness Hearing
Live</b>

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:04.940
<b>Kamakura Special Hazardous Waste Leakage Problem</b>

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.640
<i>Due to a part of the special 
forces, we were able</i>

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:07.540
<i>to avoid another situation like 
the disaster of twenty years ago.</i>

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.190
<i>We recognize that it was the best means</i>

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.990
<i>we could manage as a member 
of the Administration.</i>

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.990
Large serving of rice, please!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.840
<i>But as a result leakage of a massive amount</i>

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.190
Rice! Rice!

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.330
<i>of special hazardous waste occurred.</i>

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.330
Thank you for the food!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.330
Thank you for the food.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.710
That's all you're having, Sayaka-chan?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:23.540
Yeah.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:28.630
That won't do. You're still growing!
 You have to eat more.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.340
I don't really like this.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:33.550
You shouldn't be a picky eater.

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:35.970
Besides, the school meals 
here are pretty good.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.850
I'd rather have Mai's treats.

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:42.520
Well, Mai-chan's treats are definitely good.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.600
When is Mai coming?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.160
She should be here next week.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.820
Excuse me.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.450
Yanase-san!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:06.100
<i>The citizens would like to know what 
happened at the Administration!</i>

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.800
I've brought the list of those who 
will be temporarily transferred

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.460
to Kamakura next week.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.020
<i>We want an explanation from the 
organization's former head,</i>

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:08.160
Good work.

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.170
<i>Miss Origami Yukari.</i>

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.720
Akane-sama's subpoena?

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.260
<i>Witness Origami.</i>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.430
<i>The former head is currently recuperating.</i>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:17.680
<b>Miss Origami Akane's Witness Hearing</b>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:17.680
<b>Miss Origami Akane's Witness Hearing Regarding the
 Kamakura Special Hazardous Waste Leakage Problem</b>

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.260
<i>Do you really expect the 
citizens to believe tha—</i>

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:22.890
Right now, the Sword Administration
 is fair game.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:28.150
Whether we call it a new regime or Mokusa, 
the world only sees the same thing.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.240
The careless organization that let

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.030
a massive amount of noro 
leak out and hurt the land.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.400
I believe it is the truth.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:42.030
Perhaps, but it is still hard to 
watch them blame you and Akane-sama

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.160
<b>Special Religious Military Unit   Minoseki Academy Branch
Temporary Transfer List</b>

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:45.890
when you risked your lives protecting people.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:50.670
Oh, Yanase-san, you're transferring 
next week too, aren't you?

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.790
Yes, it's my third time.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.140
Kanami-chan has basically been
over there this whole time,

00:06:56.670 --> 00:07:00.720
but she's been working really hard to 
be like her mother the past four months.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:05.260
Etou-san does have an impressive 
mission success rate.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:06.530
Sana—

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:11.400
Director Maniwa insisted on
 keeping her close at hand.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.400
Another thing she's inherited 
from her mother, I guess.

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:18.990
You were a classmate of
 Kanami-chan's mother, weren't you?

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.940
Yes, that's right.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.160
She truly was a strong Toji.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:30.380
Honestly, I always admired her.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.170
Minato-san, you mean?

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:34.670
Yes.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:39.010
Kind of like how you feel about Etou-san,

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.590
I believe.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.970
That's why I was very happy

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:50.300
when the sword in Minoseki's care,
 Chidori, chose Etou-san.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:52.850
Yes.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.590
President Gojou?

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:25.930
It appears that someone took care 
of this house while I was away.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.980
A house has to be taken care of by people,

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.850
or it will become rundown.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:34.230
<b>Juujou Kagari</b>

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:34.230
I'm sure Akane-sama took 
that into consideration.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:41.070
Say, Hiyori-chan, are you uncertain about
 your decision to quit being a Toji?

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.610
Did you talk to Iwakura-san?

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.980
Sanae-chan seemed rather 
worried about something,

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.130
so I made her tell me.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.290
Don't blame her.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:56.090
<b>Juujou Kagari</b>

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:00.970
Twenty years ago, my mother failed 
to destroy Princess Tagitsu.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.310
It's probably a little late to 
be telling you this now, but...

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.980
Even so, I'm one of the parties involved.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.830
Princess Tagitsu,
who possessed Origami Yukari,

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:16.230
used the Toji to gather up 
noro and increase her power.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.370
Aware of this,

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.990
my mother agonized over it,
 as though it were all her fault...

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.540
Until the day she left this world.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:30.250
I swore that I would finish 
what my mother left behind.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.830
That I would destroy Origami Yukari.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.070
I did not know that.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:45.140
You really fought hard 
by yourself, didn't you?

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.460
No, I wasn't by myself.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.640
I had the help of many others.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.740
I just didn't realize it.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:57.810
And I had your help with Kogarasumaru.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:02.460
I wasn't supposed to, but I used 
a bit of my authority secretly.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.270
I was just happy that Kagari-chan's daughter

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.200
was chosen by Kogarasumaru.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:14.210
Thanks to that, I was able to fulfill 
my mother's long-cherished desire.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.670
Princess Tagitsu won't be reappearing in 
this world for the time being, at least.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:22.770
And this time, you all 
came out safe and sound.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.690
That is a remarkable achievement 
compared to twenty years ago.

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:30.130
But you're right.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.080
Your fight has come to an end.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.100
So you're thinking of retiring?

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:43.020
I thought I would wait until I 
destroy Princess Tagitsu herself,

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.490
but—

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.120
Your heart just isn't in it, is it?

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.630
I think that's all right, too.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.370
You've done more than your 
fair share of fighting.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:04.160
Think it over a bit more, and the
 answer will come to you.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.250
Understood.

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.130
Actually...

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.810
Well, I probably shouldn't mention this...

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:14.510
What is it?

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:19.500
Hey, Sayaka-chan, I have a 
bit of a favor to ask you.

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.190
What is it?

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:24.030
I was wondering if you would spar 
with me before we take a bath.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.110
Sure.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.570
Really? Yes!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.370
Are you sure you want me?

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:33.780
Why not? Of course I do!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.620
Oh, welcome back, Kaoru-chan.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:42.410
Good work. You were on an expedition, right?

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:48.220
Civil servants don't have basic labor rights.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:52.580
Moreover, those involved with
the police and firefighters like us

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.030
don't even have the privilege
of the three primary rights of labor,

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:59.390
which are the right to organize, the right
to collective bargaining, and the right to dispute.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.980
That damn power-hungry boss...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.150
You mean Director Maniwa?

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.780
Who cares if she's director?! Such crap!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:15.680
East to West, totally unfair labor practices!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.700
That inhuman meathead of a boss!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:22.390
And here I am, trying to be nice, you brat.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:23.670
Director!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.540
This is for you. Some cake.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:31.900
Cake!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.910
You're going to the time out room.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:36.420
Lemme go, you tyrant!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.420
Come on, walk.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.840
Oppressor!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.070
Dang it, why just me?!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.800
What about Ellen?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:46.540
She's doing something else for now.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.520
It's been a long time!

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.470
My precious!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.660
Fruit tarts!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.610
They look so good.

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.750
Is it really okay for us to have these?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.590
We should set one aside for Kaoru-chan.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.210
Right.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.880
Etou-san! Itomi-san!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.600
Ayumu-chan!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.810
I-It didn't take long to run into you.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.180
Etou is...?

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:16.850
The director just gave us some cake.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.810
Huh? The director? What?

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.810
Can we join you?

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.350
Of course!

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:24.230
So good!

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:31.630
Hey, are they the ones who 
destroyed that great aradama?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.590
They are.

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.760
Do you know them?

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.470
No, they just happened to 
come as our reinforcements

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:37.780
during last night's sortie.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.120
Oh, that's right!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:43.960
We're going to go spar in the dojo 
after this! Do you want to join us?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.620
No, I'm—

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.460
Please, let us observe you!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:52.030
The recovery team was attacked?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.980
Yes, and the noro was stolen.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.430
By aradama?

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.550
No, not them.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:00.810
They were attacked by a Toji.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:04.350
A Toji attacked the
recovery team? What do you mean?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.580
It means exactly that.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.030
After the aradama was destroyed by the Toji,

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.950
the recovery team's vehicle, 
which was transporting noro,

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.290
was attacked by another Toji.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.320
There have been four incidents
 like that this week,

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:18.390
and the noro was stolen in all of them.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:21.830
Hey, now, why isn't the Administration 
putting guards with them?

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:26.260
We did. After the second incident, 
we put a Toji guard on it.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.210
But it was still stolen.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.420
Our opponent is incredibly 
skilled, apparently.

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:32.240
I don't get it.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.850
What are we gonna do about 
stolen noro, anyway?

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.390
It's not like they're the Origami family.

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.430
Is that it?

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.930
Did the former Origami Yukari
 faction do this?

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.980
No, we can't draw that conclusion just yet.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.000
Anyway, according to the testimony 
of those attacked,

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.270
it was done by one person.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:52.440
One person?

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:55.450
She wore a hood big enough 
they couldn't see her face.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.520
They all said the same thing.

00:14:58.070 --> 00:14:59.870
Do we have a picture of her?

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.540
Good call. Here.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:06.250
She has an okatana, doesn't she?

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.040
The Administration can just identify that.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.750
We couldn't. Her okatana isn't in our records.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:14.550
What about her swordfighting style?

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.720
Too many styles are applicable.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.060
You should show this to Kanami.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:23.930
That swordfighting nerd would be able 
to figure out the style in no time.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:27.470
Right. I will have Etou help me soon, too,

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.310
but for now, only a few people 
have been informed of this.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.510
Making a bit much of this, are we?

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:36.240
Just trying to avoid trouble. I want to
 keep the information under control.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:40.000
So the Administration is still 
doubting its interior, huh?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.450
I guess there was the Origami 
Yukari incident, too.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.000
Call it what you will.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.000
<b>Bath</b>

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.000
<b>Renpu</b>

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.610
It's like you're on a totally 
different level from us!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.110
I wanted to spar with you both, too.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:56.050
We wouldn't be a match for you.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.800
What are your swordfighting styles?

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.910
We both studied Kurama style.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:04.110
Speaking of Kurama style at Ayanokouji,

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.520
isn't that what the elite guard,
 Konohana-san, used?

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.030
Yes, it is!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.610
Former elite guard, though.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.570
Oh, right.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.690
Konohana-san is strong, too.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.070
She is!

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:20.270
The rumor is that you defeated 
the elite guard, too.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.030
I'm getting out.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.910
I feel a bit dizzy, so I'm 
going back to my room.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.410
Sayaka-chan, thanks!

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:30.580
Your sword was as fast as ever.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.310
But it's no use.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.090
There's no point, even if I am fast.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:35.960
Huh?

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:40.970
I probably couldn't stand a 
chance if you got serious.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.970
There's that much of a difference.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:44.350
That's not...

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:46.350
True?

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:49.690
You should know.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:54.220
You're the only one in a distant place.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.940
Sayaka-chan?

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:09.910
<i>I heard from Sana-chan in Kamakura earlier.</i>

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:12.830
<i>From Director Maniwa?</i>

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:18.890
She said she would like your help again 
and has a direct assignment for you,

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.630
but things have become a bit complicated.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.440
Which means?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.440
After an aradama has been destroyed,

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:29.140
the noro recovery team has been 
attacked at several locations.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.770
By aradama?

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:35.780
Well, the culprit is also a Toji.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.450
A mysterious Toji wearing a hood.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:43.780
Mother...

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.030
I...

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:54.270
I'm the only one in a distant place?

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.860
Your friend said that?

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.610
Yeah.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.240
Well, of course you are.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.820
You're pretty strong now.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.350
Strong enough to defeat even Yukari.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:10.100
Defeat Yukari-sama?

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.730
You defeated her, right?

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.870
No way, it was hopeless for me.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.060
I couldn't keep up with Yukari-sama at all.

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:20.510
Hiyori-chan and the others 
wouldn't have been saved

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.450
if I hadn't switched with you then.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.980
Huh?

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.990
I didn't switch with you, though.

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.000
What?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.150
But when we fought in the 
depths of the shrine—

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.200
So you're the one who won, right?

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.070
Like I said, I was no match for her!

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.840
I was only half-conscious, though.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:42.630
I remember thinking that you,
my mo—master, would've been able to win.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.850
Oh, I get it.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.770
So kind of like the art of possession?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.010
Art?

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:51.750
Basically, because you came to 
believe that you had become me,

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.350
you were able to completely 
copy my mannerisms.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:55.270
No way.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:19:00.400
I mean, it's not that strange considering 
we practice together like this every night.

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:04.110
Then that was...

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.990
Your true powers.

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:10.910
Moth—Master...

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.020
Okay.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:18.170
Well, you're still a long 
ways off from me, though.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:19.960
You think so?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:24.470
So cheeky. I praise you a little
and you've already got a huge head!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.030
Now, then, shall we go a round?

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.400
Yes, please!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.900
Are these all finished?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.930
Of course.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.370
Yomi, come here.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.480
Yes.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:05.310
This is an innovative, secret 
medicine that evolves people

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:07.120
to a higher level of existence.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:11.200
With this, humanity will be free from 
all sufferings such as old age, illness,

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:16.180
physical injury, or the lack of talents.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.130
<i>She</i> came up with the theory, 
and I was able to complete it

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.560
and produce it, with assistance from you.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:26.110
This is our joint creation.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:30.560
I am grateful to you, President of Ayanokouji.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.450
<b>Konohana Suzuka</b>

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.910
What brings you here today?

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.000
Well, I wanted to ask you something.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.280
Hey, elite guard.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.130
My, you're a rare guest.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:51.380
I had heard that a lot of it had left you,
 but you still have a ways to go.

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.640
Meaning you still smell like an aradama.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:59.600
Are you sure you're not one of us,
 if you can talk to an aradama?

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:01.740
I'm human.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:05.150
Nene here may be an aradama, 
but he's not impure.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.440
Sorry, but I'm not one of you.

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:10.470
Stop baiting each other.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.570
So what is it that you wanted to ask me?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.820
Do you know this person?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.230
I can't say that I do.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.540
I can't see her face, after all.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.950
Anyone you think it might be?

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.170
Not really.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:29.710
I'll just come out and say it. 
Isn't this Shidou Maki?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.630
Maki-san?

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.970
We'll have to spar next time you're here!

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:40.640
Sure! I'll brag about seeing you 
when I get back to Ayanokouji.

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:41.920
M-Me, too!

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.270
We'll tell them that we've 
gotten to know an amazing Toji.

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:46.940
I'm not really amazing or anything...

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:48.820
See you next time, then.

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.820
You've certainly become famous.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:55.520
Hiyo...

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.580
I'm temporarily assigned 
here again, starting today.

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.030
We're together for now, Kanami.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next Episode  Family Scene</b>
